# Asset meta data for ignored folders
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Never ignore Unity generated shader/asset files
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
